sections.body:
You can:
• see and download your data (My account → Download my data);
• correct it (edit your profile, shop and listings);
• delete your account (My account), which removes your personal details;
• object to a use of your data, or withdraw consent you gave;
• complain to the Personal Data Protection Commission (Tanzania) or the Data Protection Commissioner (Zambia).
For anything else, contact us through the Help centre. We reply within 30 days.
